  "description": "agentnet.inventory-view/1 test vector: the page of the inventory of inventory-v1.json that a requester holding a task.send grant on skill:ask for the project demo sees (scope task:demo), every section in one page, with the observation in observations that the adapter of example:repo-reader made. The agent's Ed25519 secret key is 32 bytes of 0x01 (signing_key_hex); agent_id is its public key in hex, the view's agent_id. The requester's secret key is 32 bytes of 0x02 (audience_key_hex); the view's audience is its public key. agent_card_hash is the hash of card-jws-v1.json. canonical_hex is JCS (RFC 8785) of view; signature is Ed25519 over \"agentnet.inventory-view/1\\n\" followed by those bytes, base64url without padding; signed is the signed page as it travels, whose JCS is the exact bytes: {\"view\": view, \"signature\": signature}. The view leaves out every visibility, the private model example:assistant and the repository review's link to it, whose other alternative, alone in its group, shows as optional; and the MCP connection's adapter, its offered_tools and the declared tool delete_file, which it does not offer. The offered tool read_file shows as example:repo-reader/read_file, as the adapter observed it, and the observation without its tool list.",
